      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 4.95,
          "en": "To give the user some feedback that it worked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.95,
          "end": 8.38,
          "en": "we probably wanna navigate away from this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.38,
          "end": 10.82,
          "en": "once the request was sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.82,
          "end": 14.14,
          "en": "And previously, we navigated through these links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.14,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "which we added to the navigation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "Now we wanna trigger navigation programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 22.59,
          "en": "So once we're done with a certain task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.59,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "in this case once we're done with sending a http request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 29.75,
          "en": "Thankfully, implementing this is also simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.75,
          "end": 31.92,
          "en": "with React Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.92,
          "end": 36.92,
          "en": "We can simply import something from react-router-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.98,
          "end": 41.98,
          "en": "and that something is another hook. The \"useHistory\" hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.6,
          "end": 45.229,
          "en": "So, React has some built-in hooks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.229,
          "end": 50.229,
          "en": "Other third-party packages also can provide their own hooks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.3,
          "end": 52.09,
          "en": "You can also build your own hooks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.09,
          "end": 55.31,
          "en": "but we're not going to do that here in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.31,
          "end": 57.64,
          "en": "But here we've now got this \"useHistory\" hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.64,
          "end": 60.01,
          "en": "and we can call this hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.01,
          "end": 62.723,
          "en": "in the NewMeetupPage component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.75,
          "end": 65.99,
          "en": "Now this gives us a history object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.99,
          "end": 69.59,
          "en": "and that's simply a object which exposes certain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.59,
          "end": 72.19,
          "en": "methods to us that allow us to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.19,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "manipulate the browser history.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 77.15,
          "en": "To navigate away for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.15,
          "end": 79.88,
          "en": "Now here, let's say we wanna navigate away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.88,
          "end": 82.13,
          "en": "after the data was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.13,
          "end": 85.34,
          "en": "To achieve this, we can use the fact that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.34,
          "end": 87.46000000000001,
          "en": "fetch returns a Promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.46000000000001,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "which resolves as soon as this is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 92.99000000000001,
          "en": "And hence, we can add a \"then\" block here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.99000000000001,
          "end": 95.53,
          "en": "And the final function, which will execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.53,
          "end": 97.37100000000001,
          "en": "when the Promise completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.37100000000001,
          "end": 99.56,
          "en": "And it's then in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.56,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "where we wanna execute \"history\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 105.5,
          "en": "and then some method that allows us to navigate away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.5,
          "end": 107.89,
          "en": "For example, the \"push\" method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.89,
          "end": 111.92,
          "en": "To \"push\" a new page onto the stack of pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.92,
          "end": 113.9,
          "en": "In that case, we could then later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.9,
          "end": 117.68,
          "en": "use the \"back\" button to go back to the previous page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.68,
          "end": 119.443,
          "en": "And since that doesn't make too much sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.443,
          "end": 121.85,
          "en": "after submitting a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.85,
          "end": 124.28,
          "en": "I'll instead use the \"replace\" method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.28,
          "end": 127.29,
          "en": "That will navigate us away, but it won't allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.29,
          "end": 131.54,
          "en": "to use the \"back\" button to go back to the previous page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.54,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "And here, I just want to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 136.513,
          "en": "to the starting page, with \"/\" nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.53,
          "end": 139.79,
          "en": "So in the end, we pass to replace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.79,
          "end": 144.79,
          "en": "what we also passed to link to the \"to\" prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.93,
          "end": 147.07,
          "en": "Here we set up the destination,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.07,
          "end": 149.53,
          "en": "the target destination of a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.53,
          "end": 153.55,
          "en": "with the \"replace\" and \"push\" methods on history,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.55,
          "end": 157.373,
          "en": "we also passed the target path as a argument now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.62,
          "end": 160.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now instead of \"then\", we could also use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.92000000000002,
          "end": 163.493,
          "en": "async \"await\" here, by the way, if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.37,
          "end": 166.11,
          "en": "Now with that, we're navigating away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 167.98,
          "en": "once the request succeeded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.98,
          "end": 170.17000000000002,
          "en": "And therefore, let's now give this a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.17000000000002,
          "end": 171.663,
          "en": "Let's save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.69,
          "end": 176.42000000000002,
          "en": "And enter some new data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.42000000000002,
          "end": 181.42,
          "en": "I'll repeat using that image here, that dummy image URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.08,
          "end": 187.08,
          "en": "Some other address, and some other description here.",
