        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.53,
          "end": 190.64,
          "en": "And then I'll click on \"Add Meetup\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.64,
          "end": 193.643,
          "en": "And you see that I'm now navigated away.",
